    "name": "Neko No Sentouki: The Greatest Fighter",
    "steam_appid": 3628200,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>March 5, 20XX</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hikaru</strong>, a seemingly cynical and grumpy young man<strong>,</strong> who ran away from home for unknown reasons, has earned himself a really bad reputation over the last two years. But even though he's\u00a0<strong>dissatisfied</strong>\u00a0with his current living conditions, he can't find the right motivation to make a significant change and get back on track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aiko</strong>, on the other hand, is his complete opposite: lively and naive, she unwillingly wreaks havoc with her behaviour wherever she goes, and she always manages to overcome the hardships she bumps into. There's only one thing on her mind: achieving\u00a0<strong>her goal</strong>, for which she is willing to give it her all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their paths, by pure chance, cross: to pursue their goals, they make a deal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your protagonist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on\u00a0<strong>Aiko</strong>\u2019s mantle and face countless opponents in a mysterious fighting Tournament, where your abilities and your judgement will be put to the test, or help\u00a0<strong>Hikaru</strong>\u00a0unveil all the mysteries and secrets that hide behind this Tournament and its participants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Whatever you choose\u2026 try to stay alive.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hikaru Laine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628200/extras/c962b150add7a9265da8c93d17cfe581.avif?t=1751193014\" width=167 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seemingly grumpy and cynical guy. <br>For some personal reasons, Hikaru left his home and<strong>,</strong> over the last two years<strong>, </strong>lived in the streets as a thief. He\u2019s pretty fast and also skilled in the petty theft. He runs into Aiko during one of these robberies and<strong>,</strong> due to his curiosity, he decides to follow the girl to learn more about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aiko Eichel</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628200/extras/b781c919b5f0e243904e68284adcb998.avif?t=1751193014\" width=167 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She participates in the Tournament and<strong>,</strong> according to rumours<strong>, </strong>is one of the strongest challengers. Determination is one of her main characteristics: she would do anything to achieve her goal. She\u2019s clumsy and always tries to do her best when it comes to approaching other people. Her being so naive often leads her into trouble.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kyoko Graedir</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628200/extras/5c316c682acb024ab08635014b20ea63.avif?t=1751193014\" width=167 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kyoko\u2019s at the head of the Tournament\u2019s staff. <br>Her job is to keep an eye on the work of her collaborators. She\u2019s also a doctor.<br>Aiko often calls her \u201cmom\u201d, implying that there\u2019s a particular relationship between the two.<br>She\u2019s very wise and insightful, but at the same time easily irritable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minato Stehali</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628200/extras/059517a5a80d683c54548277e6b978de.avif?t=1751193014\" width=344 height=243 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aiko\u2019s self-proclaimed big brother. He gets easily jealous when it comes to the girl and can't stand anyone who approaches her. Minato has an overwhelming personality: his manner of speech is so strange that it\u2019s hard to know when he\u2019s serious or when he\u2019s joking. He also participates in the tournament and is always in the company of Ringo, his dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reko R. Vom Brand</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628200/extras/2590dde5cb8802fa6a092e159af037ba.avif?t=1751193014\" width=167 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious Tournament challenger.  <br>Whispers say to be one of the most ruthless challengers and has never lost a fight. <br>Nothing else is known.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nevy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628200/extras/f97da8c429ade4ff3b3e72c6b99c9f28.avif?t=1751193014\" width=167 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s a Tournament challenger<strong>,</strong> too. No other information is available at the moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Character-Driven Story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although you can\u2019t choose who you romance, the characters and the relationships that will form between them lie at the heart of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Points of View</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aiko and Hikaru are the two protagonists of the story. Depending on the character you choose to play as, some events in the story and CGs will change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Choices</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Possible Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 40 hours of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>19 Original Soundtracks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>26+ Backgrounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ CGs to unlock </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lot of chibi CGs</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>March 5, 20XX</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hikaru</strong>, a seemingly cynical and grumpy young man<strong>,</strong> who ran away from home for unknown reasons, has earned himself a really bad reputation over the last two years. But even though he's\u00a0<strong>dissatisfied</strong>\u00a0with his current living conditions, he can't find the right motivation to make a significant change and get back on track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aiko</strong>, on the other hand, is his complete opposite: lively and naive, she unwillingly wreaks havoc with her behaviour wherever she goes, and she always manages to overcome the hardships she bumps into. There's only one thing on her mind: achieving\u00a0<strong>her goal</strong>, for which she is willing to give it her all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their paths, by pure chance, cross: to pursue their goals, they make a deal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your protagonist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on\u00a0<strong>Aiko</strong>\u2019s mantle and face countless opponents in a mysterious fighting Tournament, where your abilities and your judgement will be put to the test, or help\u00a0<strong>Hikaru</strong>\u00a0unveil all the mysteries and secrets that hide behind this Tournament and its participants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Whatever you choose\u2026 try to stay alive.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hikaru Laine</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.s