e time easily irritable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minato Stehali</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628200/extras/059517a5a80d683c54548277e6b978de.avif?t=1751193014\" width=344 height=243 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aiko\u2019s self-proclaimed big brother. He gets easily jealous when it comes to the girl and can't stand anyone who approaches her. Minato has an overwhelming personality: his manner of speech is so strange that it\u2019s hard to know when he\u2019s serious or when he\u2019s joking. He also participates in the tournament and is always in the company of Ringo, his dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reko R. Vom Brand</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628200/extras/2590dde5cb8802fa6a092e159af037ba.avif?t=1751193014\" width=167 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious Tournament challenger.  <br>Whispers say to be one of the most ruthless challengers and has never lost a fight. <br>Nothing else is known.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nevy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628200/extras/f97da8c429ade4ff3b3e72c6b99c9f28.avif?t=1751193014\" width=167 height=241 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s a Tournament challenger<strong>,</strong> too. No other information is available at the moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Character-Driven Story</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although you can\u2019t choose who you romance, the characters and the relationships that will form between them lie at the heart of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2 Points of View</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aiko and Hikaru are the two protagonists of the story. Depending on the character you choose to play as, some events in the story and CGs will change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Choices</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Possible Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 40 hours of gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>19 Original Soundtracks</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>26+ Backgrounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+ CGs to unlock </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A lot of chibi CGs</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
